From fa0ad67f407ceb35904e00fdd3ebeaba1d2bcadd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Moritz Angermann <moritz@zw3rk.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 21:37:09 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] parser: support TypeFamilies, DataKinds, TupleSections,
 PatSyn {}, and pragmas

Refs: https://github.com/augustss/MicroHs/issues/367
Refs: https://github.com/augustss/MicroHs/issues/446
Refs: https://github.com/augustss/MicroHs/issues/226
Refs: https://github.com/augustss/MicroHs/issues/294
Refs: https://github.com/augustss/MicroHs/issues/18
Refs: https://github.com/augustss/MicroHs/issues/365

Extend the lexer, AST, and parser to accept open/closed/associated/injective
type and data family syntax, promoted DataKinds constructors and
StandaloneKindSignatures, multi-comma TupleSections, pattern synonym record
syntax, and LANGUAGE NoImplicitPrelude pragmas.
---
 src/MicroHs/Expr.hs  |  27 ++-
 src/MicroHs/Ident.hs |   4 +-
 src/MicroHs/Lex.hs   |  70 ++++++-
 src/MicroHs/Parse.hs | 453 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----
 4 files changed, 494 insertions(+), 60 deletions(-)

